+description:
+  Exposes voice call audio of the Q6 DSP (modem firmware) as PCM devices:
+  DAI 0 attaches to the circuit switched call session ("default modem
+  voice"), DAI 1 ("q6afe-rtproxy-volte") to the VoLTE call session
